          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-3 mt-0">CLI Options</h3>
          <div class="bg-bg-dark/60 p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-sm border border-border space-y-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-info"># Run a single test file</span>
              <div class="text-success">$ solidb scripts test bookmarks_test.lua</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-info"># Filter by describe/it name</span>
              <div class="text-success">$ solidb scripts test --filter "DELETE"</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-info"># Verbose output (show print() calls inside tests)</span>
              <div class="text-success">$ solidb scripts test --verbose</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mt-6 mb-3">When a Test Fails</h3>
          <div class="bg-bg-dark/60 p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-sm border border-border">
<pre class="text-text-muted">POST /bookmarks
  <span class="text-success">&#10003;</span> creates a bookmark with valid data <span class="text-text-dim">(42ms)</span>
